Description: %%DISPLAY%% %%CLI_VERSION%% for OpenWrt on %%ARCH_IPK%% (musl)
 Installs the unmodified official %%BIN%% musl build together with a procd
 service that keeps it running in remote-control mode. The daemon registers
 this machine as an environment with the Qoder cloud, so a phone or desktop
 signed in to the same account can drive it without SSH or port forwarding.
 .
 Payload arch: %%PAYLOAD_ARCH%%, libc: musl (PT_INTERP %%EXPECTED_INTERP%%).
